      "engine": "Fixed before computing: per task and per definition, (1) Holm-adjusted minimum over alpha 1 and 2 of the two-sided Fisher p at nominally matched alpha < 0.01, and (2) at the bracket (bf16 alpha 2 against FP8 alpha 1) the bf16 realised dose is at least 1.0 FP8 ban unit under both dose definitions and the bf16 share is no higher than the FP8 share. The tag 'did NOT replicate in bf16 at the population level' needs the rule under both share definitions; under one only the tag reads 'not established'.",
      "confound": "An event is unconfounded when the instruct twin measured in the same artifact and engine as the event wrote no correct program off the default. Primary membership is restricted to the held-out sets whose landings were unknown when the base forecast was committed (panels A and B, Gemma's fresh push population); the existing-task sets (FP8 screen, bf16 remeasure) were seen before their base runner-ups were read and enter only the sensitivity.",
